{"id":"50a46bce013b2772","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-filter.md","title":"Filter","display":"df-filter — Filter","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-filter","aliases":["17-df-filter"],"display":"df-filter — Filter","depends_on":["[[17-df-set-functions]]"],"label_origin":"local-catalog","source_verification":"statement-compared; proper-filter bridge checked; local empty-index extension","source_section":"4.1","source_result":"filter and proper-filter definitions","source_pages_print":[211,212],"source_pages_djvu":[227,228],"legacy_label":"17-df-4.1.1","local_revision":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-filter"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-filter</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-filter — Filter"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"571123944253d721\" href=\"?note=571123944253d721\" title=\"17-df-set-functions\">17-df-set-functions</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-catalog"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proper-filter bridge checked; local empty-index extension"},{"key":"source_section","html":"4.1"},{"key":"source_result","html":"filter and proper-filter definitions"},{"key":"source_pages_print","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>211</span><span>212</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pages_djvu","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>227</span><span>228</span></div>"},{"key":"legacy_label","html":"17-df-4.1.1"},{"key":"local_revision","html":"formal-interface repair from supplied text; inherited source_verification is not reverified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 是任意集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 是候选集合族。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,I)\\)</span> 在本条作为真滤子的二元别名定义。以下定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Filter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{Filter}_I\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I\">\\(\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I\\)</span>，参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 固定；谓词也对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\varnothing\">\\(I=\\varnothing\\)</span> 定义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Filter}_I(F)\\;&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nF\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\land I\\in F\n\\land\\forall X,Y\\in F\\;(X\\cap Y\\in F)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall X\\in F\\;\\forall Y\\subseteq I\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\to Y\\in F),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(F)\\;&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Filter}_I(F)\\land F\\neq\\mathcal P(I),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,I)\\;&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(F).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Filter}_I(F)\\;&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\;\nF\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\land I\\in F\n\\land\\forall X,Y\\in F\\;(X\\cap Y\\in F)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall X\\in F\\;\\forall Y\\subseteq I\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\to Y\\in F),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(F)\\;&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Filter}_I(F)\\land F\\neq\\mathcal P(I),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,I)\\;&amp;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(F).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书本节先规定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\\neq\\varnothing\">\\(I\\neq\\varnothing\\)</span>。这里将完全相同的谓词公式延伸到任意集合，保持跨原子全称量化的接口：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\varnothing\">\\(I=\\varnothing\\)</span> 时唯一滤子是非真滤子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\{\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>，没有真滤子，且上述桥接仍成立。这是本地的空指标扩展，不归给原书。</p>\n<p>原书 §4.1，印刷 pp.211–212（DjVu 227–228），允许非真滤子 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span>；真滤子另加排除该集合族的条件。旧稿把两谓词都别名到第58本的真滤子接口，会丢失原书这一差别。桥接式的论证：若滤子含空集，向上封闭使它等于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span>；反之 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P(I)\">\\(\\mathcal P(I)\\)</span> 含空集。因此源书的真滤子恰等于上游 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,I)\">\\(\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,I)\\)</span>。跨书籍只复用真滤子的精确签名。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-set-functions","status":"resolved","id":"571123944253d721","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-set-functions]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Filter}_I","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I","display":false},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"I=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{Filter}_I(F)\\;&\\leftrightarrow\\;\nF\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)\\land I\\in F\n\\land\\forall X,Y\\in F\\;(X\\cap Y\\in F)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall X\\in F\\;\\forall Y\\subseteq I\\;(X\\subseteq Y\\to Y\\in F),\\\\\n\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(F)\\;&\\leftrightarrow\\;\n\\operatorname{Filter}_I(F)\\land F\\neq\\mathcal P(I),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,I)\\;&\\leftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(F).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"I\\neq\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"I=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\varnothing\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal P(I)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Filter}_S(F,I)","display":false}],"bytes":2122,"backlinks":[{"id":"4a8ce12d511e773a","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I$ 是任意集合，$\\operatorname{Filter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-filter]]，包括其中明确的空指标本地扩展。以下定义集合 $\\operatorname{Filters}(I)$。"},{"id":"5deae0a21cc8b810","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I$ 为非空集合，$E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)$ 为集合族。$\\operatorname{Filter}_I$ 采用允许非真滤子的原书约定，见 [[17-df-filter]]。$e$ 为候选子族；$\\operatorname{card}$、$\\aleph_0$ 及基数次序见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]。以下定义有限交性质谓词 $\\operatorname{FIP}_I$ 与生成滤子函数 $\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I:\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I))\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal P(I))$。"},{"id":"c1db681479e4a909","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I\\neq\\varnothing$，$D$ 满足 $\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)$，见 [[17-df-filter]]；$\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$。"},{"id":"3979795456a966f2","anchor":"ref-11","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)$ (proper-filter predicate, see [[17-df-filter]])"},{"id":"bdee1a47445fb8d1","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I\\neq\\varnothing$，$D$ 满足 $\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)$，见 [[17-df-filter]]；$\\mathfrak B\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)$。"},{"id":"3807ab351b0011c6","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在含选择公理的 ZFC 元理论中工作，见 [[17-ax-zfc]]。$L$ 为一阶语言，符号分量见 [[17-df-first-order-language]]；$I$ 是非空集合，$(\\mathfrak A_i)_{i\\in I}$ 是 $L$-结构族，见 [[17-df-structure]]。$D$ 满足 $\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)$，见 [[17-df-filter]]。$\\mathrm{IndexedProduct}_S(P;\\mathcal A,I,V)$ 的参数依次是输出集合、载体族、指标集、载体族的目标集合（陪域），见 [[17-df-set-functions]]。$\\mathcal A,V,P,\\sim_D,[f]_D,Q_D$ 是下式定义的对象；$f,g\\in P$ 时使用 $f\\sim_Dg$、$[f]_D$。$\\mathfrak B$ 为候选 $L$-结构。以下定义 $\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L$，元组 $\\bar f\\in P^n$ 的第 $j$ 个分量记作 $\\bar f(j)$。"},{"id":"8da8d19dd38c73b2","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I$ (proper-filter predicate, see [[17-df-filter]])"},{"id":"9e920083cdf9b067","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I$ 是任意集合，$U$ 为候选集合族。$\\operatorname{Filter}_I$ 与 $\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-filter]]；$\\mathrm{Ultrafilter}_S(U,I)$ 在本条作为本册超滤子的二元别名定义。以下定义 $\\operatorname{Ultrafilter}_I$、$\\operatorname{Principal}_I$、$\\operatorname{Nonprincipal}_I$，也对 $I=\\varnothing$ 定义。"},{"id":"fce963a0c22b921d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$I$ 是非空集合，$E\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)$，$D=\\operatorname{GeneratedFilter}_I(E)$，见 [[17-df-generated-filter]]。$\\operatorname{Filter}_I$、$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I$ 见 [[17-df-filter]]；$\\operatorname{FIP}_I$ 见 [[17-df-generated-filter]]。"},{"id":"4b63c4b193ffc453","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)$ and $\\operatorname{ReducedProduct}_L$ (proper filters and reduced products, see [[17-df-filter]] and [[17-df-reduced-product]])"},{"id":"a7bf11e2f518df7b","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)$ (proper-filter predicate, see [[17-df-filter]])"},{"id":"49a92dfd4c1cd923","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProperFilter}_I(D)$ (proper-filter predicate, see [[17-df-filter]])"},{"id":"76b41a152803a0c7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"在 ZFC 中工作，选择公理见 [[17-ax-zfc]]。$I$ 是非空集合，$F\\subseteq\\mathcal P(I)$。$\\operator